          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Deliciously smooth milk chocolate spheres with a crunchy honeycomb centre. Make light work of your commute with Maltesers chocolates, the perfect work perk. That hour on the bus will fly by. The train won’t be a drain. And the walk to the office won’t wear you out if you’ve got Maltesers milk chocolates in your coat pocket. Dip into a pack of Maltesers and enjoy a snack that won’t cramp your style.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": null,
          "type": 10001,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Share these chocolates with a friend during a movie, over drinks or as a peace offering.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
